'''抗利尿分泌異常症'''（{{langx|en|Syndrome of inappropriate antidiuretic hormone secretion}}，SIADH）<ref name="Adrogue 2023">{{Cite journal |last=Adrogué |first=Horacio J. |last2=Madias |first2=Nicolaos E. |title=The Syndrome of Inappropriate Antidiuresis |journal=New England Journal of Medicine |date=19 October 2023 |volume=389 |issue=16 |page=1499–1509 |doi=10.1056/NEJMcp2210411 |pmid=37851876 |s2cid=264305156}}</ref>，是由于[[抗利尿激素]]的生理性的异常分泌所引发的。[[抗利尿激素]]有可能源自垂体后叶，同时也可能是由于非垂体的异常分泌所导致，例如肺部出现分泌[[抗利尿激素]]的肿瘤。<ref name="babar2013">{{Cite journal |vauthors=Babar SM |title=SIADH associated with ciprofloxacin |url=https://archive.org/details/sim_annals-of-pharmacotherapy_2013-10_47_10/page/1358 |journal=The Annals of Pharmacotherapy |date=October 2013 |volume=47 |issue=10 |page=1359–63 |doi=10.1177/1060028013502457 |pmid=24259701 |s2cid=36759747}}</ref>当[[抗利尿激素]]未受到抑制时，会促使肾小管将更多不含溶质的水分重新吸收至[[静脉]][[循环系统|循环]]中。如此一来，便会引发低張力型[[低血鈉症]]，其主要特征表现为血浆渗透压降低以及血钠水平偏低。<ref name="Adrogue 2023" />

