'''卓-艾综合征'''是一种因[[胃泌素瘤]]引起的疾病。[[胃泌素瘤]]会引發[[胃泌素]]的分泌。 <ref name=":0">{{Cite news |title=Zollinger-Ellison syndrome |url=http://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/zollinger-ellison-syndrome/basics/definition/con-20024097 |publisher=Mayo Clinic |access-date=2017-02-27 |archive-date=2017-10-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171008035222/http://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/zollinger-ellison-syndrome/basics/definition/CON-20024097 |url-status=live }}</ref>血液中胃泌素水平过高会刺激[[胃壁細胞|胃壁细胞]]释放过量的[[胃酸]]，從而導致[[胃酸]]分泌过多，过量的胃酸进而引发[[消化性潰瘍]]。<ref>{{Cite news |title=Zollinger-Ellison Syndrome |url=https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/health/conditions-and-diseases/zollingerellison-syndrome#:~:text=Zollinger-Ellison%20syndrome%20(ZES),to%20release%20too%20much%20acid. |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240915131258/https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/health/conditions-and-diseases/zollingerellison-syndrome#:~:text=Zollinger-Ellison%20syndrome%20(ZES),to%20release%20too%20much%20acid. |archive-date=2024-09-15 |access-date=2025-01-27 |language=en |url-status=live }}</ref>卓-艾综合征常见症状有[[腹痛]]和[[腹瀉]]。

