'''後心肌梗塞症候群'''（{{lang|en|postmyocardial infarction syndrome}}），又稱'''卓斯勒症候群'''（{{lang|en|Dressler syndrome}}）<ref name="pmid5039567">{{cite journal |author=Hutchcroft BJ |title=Dressler's syndrome |journal=Br Med J |volume=3 |issue=5817 |pages=49 |date=July 1972 |pmid=5039567 |pmc=1788531 |doi= 10.1136/bmj.3.5817.49-a|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_british-medical-journal_1972-07-01_3_5817/page/n132}}</ref>，是描述在心肌細胞或心包膜在受損後產生的{{tsl|en|acquired|後天性}}[[心包炎]]。常見症狀包含發燒、胸膜疼痛、心包炎，以及心包膜積水。

本疾病最早是於1956年由美國{{tsl|en|Maimonides Medical Center|瑪摩利醫院}}的{{tsl|en|William Dressler|威廉·卓斯勒}}所描述<ref name="pmid15539743">{{cite journal |vauthors=Bendjelid K, Pugin J |title=Is Dressler syndrome dead? |journal=Chest |volume=126 |issue=5 |pages=1680–2 |date=November 2004 |pmid=15539743 |doi=10.1378/chest.126.5.1680 |url=http://www.chestjournal.org/cgi/pmidlookup?view=long&pmid=15539743 |access-date=2016-10-16 |archive-date=2020-01-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200128185452/http://www.chestjournal.org/cgi/pmidlookup?view=long&pmid=15539743 |dead-url=yes }}</ref><ref name="pmid6728756">{{cite journal |vauthors=Streifler J, Pitlik S, Dux S |title=Dressler's syndrome after right ventricular infarction |journal=Postgrad Med J |volume=60 |issue=702 |pages=298–300 |date=April 1984 |pmid=6728756 |pmc=2417818 |doi= 10.1136/pgmj.60.702.298|url=|display-authors=etal}}</ref><ref name="pmid13605300">{{cite journal |author=Dressler W |title=The post-myocardial-infarction syndrome: a report on forty-four cases |journal=AMA Arch Intern Med |volume=103 |issue=1 |pages=28–42 |date=January 1959 |pmid=13605300 |doi= 10.1001/archinte.1959.00270010034006|url=}}</ref>。

==表現==
在過去，後心肌梗塞症候群約佔[[心肌梗塞]]倖存者的7%<ref>{{cite journal | doi = 10.1056/NEJM198411083111903 |vauthors=Krainin F, Flessas A, Spodick D | title = Infarction-associated pericarditis. Rarity of diagnostic electrocardiogram | url = https://archive.org/details/sim_new-england-journal-of-medicine_1984-11-08_311_19/page/1210 | journal = N Engl J Med | volume = 311 | issue = 19 | pages = 1211–4 | year = 1984 | pmid = 6493274}}</ref>，但在冠心病介入性治療發展之後則極少出現。本疾病會持續低程度的[[发热]]、[[胸痛]]（通常是[[胸膜炎]]所致）、心內膜炎（常可聽見{{tsl|en|pericardial friction rub|心包摩擦音}}），或{{tsl|en|pericardial effusion|心包膜積水}}。後心肌梗塞症候群通常發生於心肌梗塞後2-3周，但也可能延遲至數個月以上。症狀通常在數日內減低，偶爾會導致[[心包填塞]]<ref>{{cite journal|last=Hertzeanu|first=H|author2=Almog, C |author3=Algom, M |title=Cardiac tamponade in Dressler's syndrome. Case report.|journal=Cardiology|date=1983|volume=70|issue=1|pages=31–6|pmid=6850684|doi=10.1159/000173566}}<!--|accessdate=6 February 2014--></ref>。實驗室診斷則可藉由[[红细胞沉降率]]來協助。

==病因==
目前相信本疾病屬於[[自體免疫]]發炎反應。

