'''癌症筛查'''又稱'''腫瘤筛查'''，旨在[[癌症]]症状出现之前就发现癌症。<ref name="NIH">{{Cite web|title=What Is Cancer Screening?|url=http://www.cancer.gov/cancertopics/pdq/screening/overview/Patient|date=2010-01-13|publisher=[[国家癌症研究所]]|access-date=2021-11-05|archive-date=2015-04-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150404184938/http://www.cancer.gov/cancertopics/pdq/screening/overview/patient|dead-url=no}}</ref>这可能涉及[[血液检查|血液检测]]、[[尿液分析]]、DNA检测或[[醫學影像]]等項目。<ref name="NIH" /><ref>{{Cite web|title=Press Announcements - FDA authorizes, with special controls, direct-to-consumer test that reports three mutations in the BRCA breast cancer genes|url=https://www.fda.gov/newsevents/newsroom/pressannouncements/ucm599560.htm|date=2019-09-10|access-date=2021-11-05|archive-date=2019-04-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190423072211/https://www.fda.gov/NewsEvents/Newsroom/PressAnnouncements/ucm599560.htm|dead-url=no}}</ref>癌症筛查可以在癌症尚在早期時就诊断出來。因為癌症在早期時如果就能及時確診的話，可以有更高的成功治疗率以及延长壽命。不過筛查也有可能导致假阳性结果和随后進行的侵入性手术（即因為錯誤得出陽性結論而進行不必要的手術）。<ref name="Croswell2009">{{Cite journal|title=Cumulative incidence of false-positive results in repeated, multimodal cancer screening|last=Croswell|first=JM|last2=Kramer|first2=BS|journal={{link-en|Annals of Family Medicine}}|issue=3|doi=10.1370/afm.942|year=2009|volume=7|pages=212–22|pmc=2682972|pmid=19433838|laydate=Gelmann|last3=Kreimer|first3=AR|last4=Prorok|first4=PC|last5=Xu|first5=JL|last6=Baker|first6=SG|last7=Fagerstrom|first7=R|last8=Riley|first8=TL|last9=Clapp|first9=JD|display-authors=4}}</ref>筛查也可能导致假阴性结果，即遗漏癌症。<ref name="SIcancerscreening">{{Cite journal|title=Screening for prostate and breast cancer: It's more complex than you may think|last=Nogueira|first=Felipe|date=2019|journal=Skeptical Inquirer|issue=1|volume=43|pages=50–53}}</ref>必须权衡癌症筛查在{{link-en|癌症预防|Cancer prevention}}、早期发现和后续治疗方面的好处与危害。

[[疾病篩檢]]，也称为大规模筛查或人群筛查，涉及对每个人进行筛查，通常是對特定年龄人群進行篩查。<ref name="Wilson">{{Cite book|last=Wilson|first=JMG|last2=Jungner|first2=G|year=1968|url=http://whqlibdoc.who.int/php/WHO_PHP_34.pdf|title=Principles and Practice of Screening for Disease|location=Geneva|publisher=[[世界卫生组织]]|series=Public Health Papers|volume=34|access-date=2021-11-05|archive-date=2011-06-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20110604205519/http://whqlibdoc.who.int/php/WHO_PHP_34.pdf|dead-url=no}}</ref>。选择性筛查可以确定那些已知罹患癌症风险较高的人，如有癌症家族史的人。<ref name="Wilson" />

筛查必须有效、安全，[[假阳性和假阴性结果]]的比率必須保持較低水平。如果发现了癌症的迹象，就要进行更明确的、侵入性的后续检查以確定是否患有癌症。

