'''XMEN病'''是一種罕見遺傳性免疫疾病。英文病名簡寫XMEN，其全名為「[[X染色體]]性聯免疫缺乏合併[[鎂]]缺乏(M)、[[EB病毒]](E)、腫瘤(N)」。疾病特徵為[[CD4+淋巴球]]不足、嚴重慢性病毒感染、以及T淋巴球活化之缺陷。美國衛生研究院免疫感染研究所的Michael Lenardo團隊在2011年首度報告此疾病。<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.niaid.nih.gov/diseases-conditions/scientists-identify-mutation-xmen-disease|title=Scientists Identify the Genetic Mutation Causing "XMEN" Disease|accessdate=2017-04-13|author=NIH/NIAID|date=July 11, 2013|publisher=|archive-date=2017-07-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170705104551/https://www.niaid.nih.gov/diseases-conditions/scientists-identify-mutation-xmen-disease}}</ref><ref name="Li 2011 Nature">{{cite journal|title=Second messenger role for Mg(2+) revealed by human T-cell immunodeficiency|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_nature-uk_2011-07-28_475_7357/page/470|last=Li FY|last2=Chaigne-Delalande|first2=B|date=2011|journal=Nature|doi=10.1038/nature10246|volume=475|pages=471–476|pmc=3159560|pmid=21796205|last3=Kanellopoulou|first3=C|last4=Davis|first4=JC|last5=Matthews|first5=HF|last6=Douek|first6=DC|last7=Cohen|first7=JI|last8=Uzel|first8=G|last9=Su|first9=HC|last10=Lenardo|first10=MJ}}</ref><ref name="Chaigne-Delalande 2013 Science">{{cite journal|title=Mg2+ regulates cytotoxic functions of NK and CD8 T cells in chronic EBV infection through NKG2D|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_science_2013-07-12_341_6142/page/186|last=Chaigne-Delalande B|last2=Li|first2=FY|date=2013|journal=Science|issue=6142|doi=10.1126/science.1240094|volume=341|pages=186–191|pmc=3894782|pmid=23846901|last3=O'Connor|first3=GM|last4=Lukacs|first4=MJ|last5=Jiang|first5=P|last6=Zheng|first6=L|last7=Shatzer|first7=A|last8=Biancalana|first8=M|last9=Pittaluga|first9=S|last10=Matthews|first10=HF|last11=Jancel|first11=TJ|last12=Bleesing|first12=JJ|last13=Marsh|first13=RA|last14=Kuijpers|first14=TW|last15=Nichols|first15=KE|last16=Lucas|first16=CL|last17=Nagpal|first17=S|last18=Mehmet|first18=H|last19=Su|first19=HC|last20=Cohen|first20=JI|last21=Uzel|first21=G|last22=Lenardo|first22=MJ}}</ref><ref name="Li Blood 2014">{{cite journal|title=XMEN disease: a new primary immunodeficiency affecting Mg2+ regulation of immunity against Epstein-Barr virus|last=Li FY|last2=Chaigne-Delalande|first2=B|date=2014|journal=Blood|issue=14|doi=10.1182/blood-2013-11-538686|volume=123|pages=2148–52|pmid=24550228|last3=Su|first3=HC|last4=Uzel|first4=G|last5=Matthews|first5=HF|last6=Lenardo|first6=MJ}}</ref>

因為人類X性染色體上的基因MAGT1變異，導致該基因所表現的鎂離子傳遞蛋白功能缺陷，導致XMEN<ref name="Li 2011 Nature" />。鎂離子傳遞蛋白對體內鎂離子的平衡扮演重要角色。<ref name="Zhou 2009">{{cite journal|title=Mammalian MAGT1 and TUSC3 are required for cellular magnesium uptake and vertebrate embryonic development|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_proceedings-of-the-national-academy-of-sciences-usa_2009-09-15_106_37/page/15751|last=Zhou|last2=Clapham|first2=David E.|date=2009|journal=Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States of America|issue=37|doi=10.1073/pnas.0908332106|volume=106|pages=15751–15755|pmc=2732712|pmid=19717468|first1=Hao}}</ref>由於該基因位於X染色體上，因此該基因缺陷為[[性聯遺傳]]模式。不過，環境因子與其他基因會影響疾病嚴重度。<ref name="Chaigne-Delalande 2013 Science" />

XMEN病人一般會具有慢性的EB病毒感染，CD4+淋巴球減少、[[B淋巴球]]量提高、以及[[中性球]]輕微不足的現象。臨床上會依照病人的症狀予以治療。鎂離子補充可能是個治療方向，但目前對於藉此方法治療XMEN或預防淋巴癌發生的效果尚未知。美國國家衛生研究院正在進行診斷與治療此遺傳疾病的方法。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT00246857|title=Screening Protocol for Genetic Diseases of Lymphocyte Homeostasis and Programmed Cell Death|date=May 2015|publisher=U.S. National Institutes of Health|website=ClinicalTrials.gov|id=NCT00246857|access-date=2017-04-13|archive-date=2021-04-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210402071820/https://www.clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT00246857}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT00001467|title=Genetic Analysis of Immune Disorders|date=May 2015|publisher=U.S. National Institutes of Health|website=ClinicalTrials.gov|id=NCT00001467|access-date=2017-04-13|archive-date=2021-05-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210505135536/http://www.clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT00001467}}</ref>

