'''XY性腺发育不全'''（{{langx|en|XY gonadal dysgenesis}}），也称为'''斯威爾症候群'''（{{langx|en|Swyer syndrome}}），是第23對染色體為XY的人的一种[[性腺机能减退]]症。由於患者的Y染色體失去[[SRY基因]]，所以他们通常有正常的[[女性外生殖器]]，[[性別認同]]为女性，并作为女孩撫養长大<ref name=GHR2019>{{cite web |last1=Reference |first1=Genetics Home |title=Swyer syndrome |url=https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/swyer-syndrome |website=Genetics Home Reference |accessdate=6 May 2019 |language=en |archive-date=2019-12-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20191216225539/https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/swyer-syndrome |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

患者外表为女性，但[[性腺形成不全]]，称为「条索状性腺」（streak gonads）<ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Nistal |first1=Manuel |last2=Paniagua |first2=Ricardo |last3=González-Peramato |first3=Pilar |last4=Reyes-Múgica |first4=Miguel |date=2015 |title=Perspectives in Pediatric Pathology, Chapter 5. Gonadal Dysgenesis |url=https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.2350/14-04-1471-PB.1 |journal=Pediatric and Developmental Pathology |language=en |volume=18 |issue=4 |pages=259–278 |doi=10.2350/14-04-1471-PB.1 |pmid=25105336 |issn=1093-5266 |url-access=subscription |access-date=2026-02-26 |archive-date=2025-05-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250528184433/https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.2350/14-04-1471-PB.1 |url-status=live }}</ref>。这种性腺通常需要通过手术切除（因为它们有患癌症的巨大风险，且没有内分泌功能<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://rarediseases.org/rare-diseases/swyer-syndrome/|title=Swyer syndrome|website=National Organization for Rare Disorders (NORD)|access-date=2026-02-26|archive-date=2021-10-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211009130458/https://rarediseases.org/rare-diseases/swyer-syndrome/|url-status=live}}</ref>
）。典型的治疗方法是[[激素替代疗法]]<ref>{{cite journal |vauthors=Massanyi EZ, Dicarlo HN, Migeon CJ, Gearhart JP | title = Review and management of 46,XY disorders of sex development.| journal = J Pediatr Urol. | volume = 9 | issue = 3 | pages = 368–379 | date = 29 December 2012 | pmid = 23276787 | pmc = | doi = 10.1016/j.jpurol.2012.12.002 }}</ref>。在斯威爾症候群中，有時可以使用[[輔助生殖技術]]懷孕<ref>{{cite journal |last1=Taneja |first1=Jyoti |last2=Ogutu |first2=David |last3=Ah-Moye |first3=Michael |title=Rare successful pregnancy in a patient with Swyer Syndrome |journal=Case Reports in Women's Health |date=18 October 2016 |volume=12 |pages=1–2 |doi=10.1016/j.crwh.2016.10.001 |pmid=29629300 |pmc=5885995 |issn=2214-9112}}</ref><ref>{{cite journal |last1=Urban |first1=Aleksandra |last2=Knap-Wielgus |first2=Weronika |last3=Grymowicz |first3=Monika |last4=Smolarczyk |first4=Roman |title=Two successful pregnancies after in vitro fertilisation with oocyte donation in a patient with Swyer syndrome – a case report |journal=Przegla̜d Menopauzalny = Menopause Review |date=September 2021 |volume=20 |issue=3 |pages=158–161 |doi=10.5114/pm.2021.109361 |pmid=34703418 |pmc=8525253 |issn=1643-8876}}</ref><ref>{{cite journal |last1=Gupta |first1=Anupam |last2=Bajaj |first2=Ritika |last3=Jindal |first3=Umesh N. |title=A Rare Case of Swyer Syndrome in Two Sisters with Successful Pregnancy Outcome in Both |journal=Journal of Human Reproductive Sciences |date=2019 |volume=12 |issue=3 |pages=267–269 |doi=10.4103/jhrs.JHRS_14_19 |doi-access=free |pmid=31576088 |pmc=6764226 |issn=0974-1208}}</ref>。

