'''上呼吸道阻力症候群'''（{{langx|en|upper airway resistance syndrome、UARS}}）是一種常見的[[睡眠障礙]]。UARS的特徵是睡眠受到[[上呼吸道]]逐漸變窄的影響。UARS的症狀、診斷、治療方法等面向都與[[阻塞性睡眠呼吸中止症]]極為類似。<ref>>Shneerson, John M., ed. (2005). Sleep Medicine (Second ed.). New York: Blackwell Publishing. pp. 229-237.</ref><ref>Cuelbras, Antonio (1996). Clinical Handbook of Sleep Disorders. New York: Butterworth-Heinemann. pp. 207.</ref><ref>de Godoy, Luciana B.M.; Palombini, Luciana O.; Guilleminault, Christian; Poyares, Dalva; Tufik, Sergio; Togeiro, Sonia M. (2015). "Treatment of upper airway resistance syndrome in adults: Where do we stand?". Sleep Science: 42–48 – via Elsevier.</ref>
