{{Medical}}{{Expert}}{{Proofreader needed|en|Post-nasal drip}}{{Infobox medical condition (new)|name=鼻后滴流综合征|synonyms=上气道咳嗽综合征|image=File:Post nasal drip en.png|caption=鼻后滴流综合征|field=[[耳鼻喉科]]}}

'''上气道咳嗽综合征'''（{{langx|en|upper airway cough syndrome}}），旧称'''鼻后滴漏综合征'''（{{langx|en|post-nasal drip syndrome}}）<ref>{{Cite book |title=内科学 |author=葛均波，王辰，王建安主编 |publisher=[[人民卫生出版社]] |location=北京 |year=2024 |isbn=978-7-117-36571-0 |page=11 |edition=10版}}</ref>，俗称'''鼻涕倒流<ref>{{Cite web |title=慢性咳嗽 {{!}} 衛教單張 - 中國醫藥大學附設醫院 |url=http://www.cmuh.cmu.edu.tw/HealthEdus/Detail?no=5142 |website=www.cmuh.cmu.edu.tw |language=zh-Hant |access-date=2025-07-13 |archive-date=2026-03-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260315022819/https://www.cmuh.cmu.edu.tw/HealthEdus/Detail?no=5142 |url-status=live }}</ref>'''，是由于鼻部疾病引起分泌物倒流至鼻后和咽喉等部，刺激[[咳嗽]]感受器，导致以咳嗽为主要表现的综合征。<ref>{{Cite journal |last=刘淑芸 |last2=钟红卫 |title=上气道咳嗽综合征的中西医诊治进展 |url=https://rs.yiigle.com/cmaid/931724 |journal=中国基层医药 |language=zh |date=2016-12-01 |volume=23 |issue=23 |doi=10.3760/cma.j.issn.1008-6706.2016.23.041 |issn=1008-6706 |access-date=2025-07-13}}</ref>它的可能成因包括[[鼻炎]]、[[鼻窦炎]]、[[胃食道逆流]]、[[吞咽障碍]]（如[[食管动力障碍]]）、[[过敏]]、[[感冒]]以及医疗副作用。<ref name=":02">{{Cite news|url=https://www.webmd.com/allergies/postnasal-drip#1|title=Postnasal Drip: Causes, Treatments, Symptoms, and More|work=WebMD|language=en-US|access-date=2018-04-02|archive-date=2018-07-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180711182211/https://www.webmd.com/allergies/postnasal-drip#1|dead-url=no}}</ref>

有研究人员认为，鼻腔后部的黏液下流是一种在健康人群中也会出现的正常生理过程。<ref name="Morice 20042">{{cite journal|title=Post-nasal drip syndrome--a symptom to be sniffed at?|last=Morice|first=AH|journal=Pulmonary Pharmacology & Therapeutics|issue=6|doi=10.1016/j.pupt.2004.09.005|year=2004|volume=17|pages=343–5|pmid=15564073}}</ref>由于该综合征在世界各地差异很大，且缺乏公认的定义、没有病理组织变化也没有适用的生化检验，现在更多人认为它是一种症状，而不是疾病。<ref name="Morice 20042" />

== 症状和体征 ==
鼻后滴流综合征患者可能会持续感到上呼吸道不适。由于黏液自鼻黏膜流至咽喉后部，患者会咳嗽。不适感有几率因为咳嗽导致其他感染而变得更为明显。{{Mcn}}

胃食道逆流通常伴有与鼻后滴流综合征类似的上呼吸道症状，如咳嗽、清嗓子、声音嘶哑或音色改变。胃食道逆流会刺激咽喉，引起患者感觉咽喉黏液增加。据信这会加剧鼻后滴流综合征，甚至可能在未有鼻后滴流综合征的情况下诱发此症。{{Mcn}}

鼻后滴流综合征可能是喉部炎症或气道高反应性的病因，并引起{{Link-en|声带功能障碍|vocal cord dysfunction}}。<ref>{{Cite journal|title=Paradoxical vocal cord motion disorder: past, present and future|url=http://pmj.bmj.com/content/83/977/164|last=Ibrahim|first=Wanis H.|last2=Gheriani|first2=Heitham A.|date=2007-03-01|journal=Postgraduate Medical Journal|issue=977|doi=10.1136/pgmj.2006.052522|volume=83|pages=164–172|language=en|issn=1469-0756|pmc=2599980|pmid=17344570|last3=Almohamed|first3=Ahmed A.|last4=Raza|first4=Tasleem|access-date=2018-12-19|archive-date=2018-06-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180616231318/http://pmj.bmj.com/content/83/977/164|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal|title=Vocal cord dysfunction: an update|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_annals-of-allergy-asthma-and-immunology_2011-04_106_4/page/267|last=Gimenez|last2=Zafra|journal=Annals of Allergy, Asthma & Immunology|issue=4|doi=10.1016/j.anai.2010.09.004|year=2011|volume=106|pages=267–274|pmid=21457874}}</ref>

== 诊断 ==
在没有任何准确客观的医学检验的情况下，仅依靠患者自身关于咽喉滴流感的描述进行的长期观察可能是不准确且有偏差的。由于直接指向具体病症的症状的描述本身不可靠，应使用[[内窥镜|鼻镜]]之类的便于观察鼻腔炎症反应与粘脓性分泌物的方式辅助诊断。<ref>{{Cite journal|title=Chronic Upper Airway Cough Syndrome Secondary to Rhinosinus Diseases (Previously Referred to as  Postnasal Drip Syndrome )|last=Pratter|first=Melvin R.|date=2006|journal=Chest|issue=1|doi=10.1378/chest.129.1_suppl.63s|volume=129|pages=63S–71S|issn=0012-3692|pmid=16428694}}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal|title=Chronic Cough, Reflux, Postnasal Drip Syndrome, and the Otolaryngologist|url=https://www.hindawi.com/journals/ijoto/2012/564852/|last=Sylvester|first=Deborah C.|last2=Karkos|first2=Petros D.|date=2012|journal=International Journal of Otolaryngology|doi=10.1155/2012/564852|volume=2012|pages=1–5|language=en|issn=1687-9201|pmc=3332192|pmid=22577385|last3=Vaughan|first3=Casey|last4=Johnston|first4=James|last5=Dwivedi|first5=Raghav C.|last6=Atkinson|first6=Helen|last7=Kortequee|first7=Shah|access-date=2018-12-19|archive-date=2020-09-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200925014216/https://www.hindawi.com/journals/ijoto/2012/564852/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

== 治疗 ==
治疗方式取决于鼻后滴流综合征的性质与诱因。细菌感染导致的鼻后滴流可以开以抗生素。<ref name=":1">{{Cite news |title=Post-nasal drip |url=https://www.healthdirect.gov.au/post-nasal-drip |last=Australia |first=Healthdirect |date=2018-04-06 |language=en-AU |access-date=2018-09-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210118202521/https://www.healthdirect.gov.au/post-nasal-drip |archive-date=2021-01-18 |dead-url=no}}</ref>过敏引起的鼻后滴流则应用抗组胺药治疗，但需要注意的是，第一代抗组胺药会有嗜睡等副作用。<ref name=":0">{{Cite news|url=https://www.webmd.com/allergies/postnasal-drip#1|title=Postnasal Drip: Causes, Treatments, Symptoms, and More|work=WebMD|language=en-US|access-date=2018-04-02|archive-date=2018-07-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180711182211/https://www.webmd.com/allergies/postnasal-drip#1|dead-url=no}}</ref>[[丙酸氟替卡松]]之类的鼻用皮质类固醇也可能有效。<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.webmd.com/allergies/nasal-steroids|title=Can Nasal Steroids Ease Allergy Symptoms?|work=WebMD|language=en-US|access-date=2018-04-02|archive-date=2018-06-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180616231323/https://www.webmd.com/allergies/nasal-steroids|dead-url=no}}</ref>减充血剂，如止咳药，可通过使血管收缩，從而收縮黏膜以减轻症状。<ref name=":3">{{Cite news|url=https://www.health.harvard.edu/staying-healthy/that-nagging-cough|title=That nagging cough - Harvard Health|last=Publishing|first=Harvard Health|work=Harvard Health|language=en-US|access-date=2018-09-21|archive-date=2021-04-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210428021013/https://www.health.harvard.edu/staying-healthy/that-nagging-cough|dead-url=no}}</ref>

保持水分摄入并避免摄入酒精与咖啡因制品是很重要的。鉴于香烟烟雾在吸入后会增加不适感，建议患者不要吸烟。多喝水，尤其是多饮用可稀释黏液的饮料（如热水），也不失为一个好办法。进行盐水基鼻喷雾之类的鼻腔冲洗有助于缓解咽喉分泌物引起的不适。患者也可以使用处方类固醇鼻喷剂，该类喷剂相比非处方减充血喷剂更为安全有效，且作用时间更长。<ref name=":1" /><ref name=":3" />

