'''不适'''<ref>{{樂詞網|term =不適 |urlid =30ad6780162ec924fa12458a4b9f6bb1 }}</ref><ref>舒军萍,陈蔚,牛娜,等. 输注化疗药物的浓度对减少输液不适感的临床观察与探讨[J]. 中华现代护理杂志,2005,11:(05)：344-345. DOI:10.3760/cma.j.issn.1674-2907.2005.05.006</ref>（{{langx|en|malaise}}）或'''不舒服'''（discomfort）是一种全身不快、欠安或缺乏健康的感觉，通常是[[感染]]或其他疾病的第一个[[症状]]。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://medlineplus.gov/ency/article/003089.htm|title=Malaise: MedlinePlus Medical Encyclopedia|website=medlineplus.gov| archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20160916154928/https://medlineplus.gov/ency/article/003089.htm|archivedate=2016-09-16|df=|accessdate=2018-09-15}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.nytimes.com/section/well|title=Well|author=|date=|publisher=|via=NYTimes.com|deadurl=no|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20180424040459/https://www.nytimes.com/section/well|archivedate=2018-04-24|df=|accessdate=2018-09-15}}</ref> 。它可能是由免疫反應引起的，特別是細胞因子釋放<ref>{{cite journal | vauthors = Vignau J, Karila L, Costisella O, Canva V | title = Hépatite C, Interféron α et dépression : principales hypothèses physiopathologiques | journal = L'Encéphale | volume = 31 | issue = 3 | pages = 349-357 | date = Juin 2005 | pmid = 16142050 | doi=10.1016/S0013-7006(05)82400-5 }}</ref>。

