<!--定義及症狀-->
'''中耳炎'''（otitis media）是一系列[[中耳]]發炎疾病之統稱<ref name="Qu2014">{{Cite journal|title=Update on otitis media - prevention and treatment|url=https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24453496|last=Qureishi|first=Ali|last2=Lee|first2=Yan|date=2014-01-10|journal=Infection and Drug Resistance|doi=10.2147/IDR.S39637|volume=7|pages=15–24|issn=1178-6973|pmc=3894142|pmid=24453496|last3=Belfield|first3=Katherine|last4=Birchall|first4=John P.|last5=Daniel|first5=Matija|access-date=2020-10-28|archive-date=2021-01-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210107061917/https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24453496/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。其中以[[急性中耳炎]]（AOM）和[[中耳積水]]（OME）兩型最為常見<ref name="CDC2013Ear">{{cite web|title=Ear Infections|url=http://www.cdc.gov/getsmart/antibiotic-use/URI/ear-infection.html|accessdate=14 February 2015|date=September 30, 2013|work=cdc.gov|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20150219034155/http://www.cdc.gov/getsmart/antibiotic-use/uri/ear-infection.html|archivedate=2015-02-19|dead-url=no}}</ref>。急性中耳炎為急性[[感染]]所致，耳朵疼痛為其常見的臨床症狀。罹患急性中耳炎的幼童，常有拉扯耳朵、哭聲次數增加及睡眠品質不佳等情況，有時也會有食欲不振或[[發燒]]的情形。中耳積水一般沒有症狀<ref name="Peads2013">{{Cite journal|title=The diagnosis and management of acute otitis media|url=https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23439909|last=Lieberthal|first=Allan S.|last2=Carroll|first2=Aaron E.|date=2013-03|journal=Pediatrics|issue=3|doi=10.1542/peds.2012-3488|volume=131|pages=e964–999|issn=1098-4275|pmid=23439909|last3=Chonmaitree|first3=Tasnee|last4=Ganiats|first4=Theodore G.|last5=Hoberman|first5=Alejandro|last6=Jackson|first6=Mary Anne|last7=Joffe|first7=Mark D.|last8=Miller|first8=Donald T.|last9=Rosenfeld|first9=Richard M.|access-date=2020-10-28|archive-date=2021-01-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210107061926/https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23439909/|dead-url=no}}</ref><!--Occasionally a feeling of fullness is described.-->，中耳積水的定義是在耳朵中有出現不是因為感染而產生的液體，時間已超過三個月以上。慢性化脓性中耳炎（CSOM）是指中耳發炎已超過二週，因此耳朵開始化脓，也可能是急性中耳炎後的併發症。中耳炎很少會疼痛，不過都會伴隨著[[聽覺障礙]]的情形<ref name=Qu2014/><ref name=CDC2013Ear/>。若是長期中耳炎造成的聽覺障礙，會影響兒童的學習能力<ref name="Min2014">{{Cite journal|title=Diseases of the middle ear in childhood|url=http://www.egms.de/en/journals/cto/2014-13/cto000114.shtml|last=Minovi|first=Amir|last2=Dazert|first2=Stefan|date=2014|journal=GMS Current Topics in Otorhinolaryngology - Head and Neck Surgery; 13:Doc11; ISSN 1865-1011|doi=10.3205/CTO000114|language=en|pmc=4273172|pmid=25587371}}</ref>。[[中医]]称中耳炎为“耳脓”、“耳疳”，认为是因肝胆湿热（火）邪气盛行引起。{{Citation needed}}

<!-- 病因與診斷 -->
造成急性中耳炎的原因與孩童時代的耳部構造及[[免疫系統]]有關<!-- <ref name=Min2014/> -->。 細菌或病毒都有可能是致病因子<!-- <ref name=Min2014/> -->。危險因子包含：暴露於煙霧中、使用[[奶嘴]]、以及待在日間托兒中心<!-- <ref name=Min2014/> -->。急性中耳炎較常發生在[[美洲原住民]]或[[唐氏症]]患者身上<ref name="Min2014" />。中耳積水則常常伴隨在急性中耳炎之後發生，但也可能與[[上呼吸道]]病毒感染、煙霧等刺激物、或是[[過敏原]]有關<ref name="CDC2013Ear" /><ref name="Min2014" />。耳膜視診對於做出正確的診斷來說是重要的<ref name="Coker2010">{{Cite journal|title=Diagnosis, microbial epidemiology, and antibiotic treatment of acute otitis media in children: a systematic review|url=https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21081729|last=Coker|first=Tumaini R.|last2=Chan|first2=Linda S.|date=2010-11-17|journal=JAMA|issue=19|doi=10.1001/jama.2010.1651|volume=304|pages=2161–2169|issn=1538-3598|pmid=21081729|last3=Newberry|first3=Sydne J.|last4=Limbos|first4=Mary Ann|last5=Suttorp|first5=Marika J.|last6=Shekelle|first6=Paul G.|last7=Takata|first7=Glenn S.|access-date=2020-10-28|archive-date=2021-01-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210107061946/https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21081729/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。急性中耳炎的病徵包括[[耳膜]]向外凸出、無法像在正常情況下那樣受空氣的擾動而震動<ref name="Peads2013" /><ref name="CDC2013A">{{cite web|title=Otitis Media: Physician Information Sheet (Pediatrics)|url=http://www.cdc.gov/getsmart/campaign-materials/info-sheets/child-otitismedia.html|accessdate=14 February 2015|date=November 4, 2013|work=cdc.gov|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20150429213339/http://www.cdc.gov/getsmart/campaign-materials/info-sheets/child-otitismedia.html|archivedate=2015-04-29|dead-url=no}}</ref>。若耳朵有新分泌物，但是沒有[[外耳炎]]，也可能是中耳炎<ref name="Peads2013" />。

<!-- 預防與治療  -->
注射[[肺炎鏈球菌疫苗]]、[[流感疫苗]]、六個月以下的嬰兒完全[[餵母乳]]以及避免接觸香煙能夠降低罹患中耳炎的風險<ref name="Peads2013" />。在滲出性中耳炎的病患使用[[抗生素]]不會加速疾病的復原<ref name="CDC2013A" /><ref>{{Cite journal|title=Antibiotics for otitis media with effusion in children|url=https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22972136|last=van Zon|first=Alice|last2=van der Heijden|first2=Geert J.|date=2012-09-12|journal=The Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews|issue=9|doi=10.1002/14651858.CD009163.pub2|pages=CD009163|issn=1469-493X|pmid=22972136|last3=van Dongen|first3=Thijs M. A.|last4=Burton|first4=Martin J.|last5=Schilder|first5=Anne G. M.|access-date=2020-10-28|archive-date=2021-01-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210107062029/https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22972136/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。在急性中耳炎的病患使用[[止痛劑]]是很重要的<ref name="Peads2013" />，這包括了[[对乙酰氨基酚]]、[[布洛芬]]、[[苯佐卡因]]耳藥水或是[[鴉片類藥物]]<ref name="Peads2013" />。抗生素能夠加速急性中耳炎的恢復，但有可能會造成副作用<ref>{{Cite journal|title=Antibiotics for acute otitis media in children|url=https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23440776|last=Venekamp|first=Roderick P.|last2=Sanders|first2=Sharon|date=2013-01-31|journal=The Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews|issue=1|doi=10.1002/14651858.CD000219.pub3|pages=CD000219|issn=1469-493X|pmid=23440776|last3=Glasziou|first3=Paul P.|last4=Del Mar|first4=Chris B.|last5=Rovers|first5=Maroeska M.|access-date=2020-10-28|archive-date=2021-01-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210107061951/https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23440776/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。抗生素被建議使用在病情嚴重或小於兩歲的病患<!-- <ref name=CDC2013A/> -->對於病情較不嚴重的病患，抗生素只有建議在兩或三天後病情還沒有改善的病患上使用。<ref name="CDC2013A" />一般上會先使用[[阿莫西林|安莫西林]]（amoxicilin）來當做抗生素<!-- <ref name=Peads2013/> -->對於反复中耳炎感染的病患，{{le|鼓膜造孔術|Tympanostomy tube}}可能可以降低復發率<ref name="Peads2013" />。

<!-- 流行病學 -->
急性中耳炎影響了全球約11%的人口（約7.1億人）<ref name="Mon2012">{{Cite journal|title=Burden of Disease Caused by Otitis Media: Systematic Review and Global Estimates|url=https://dx.plos.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0036226|last=Monasta|first=Lorenzo|last2=Ronfani|first2=Luca|date=2012-04-30|journal=PLoS ONE|issue=4|doi=10.1371/journal.pone.0036226|editor-last=Moormann|editor-first=Ann M.|volume=7|pages=e36226|language=en|issn=1932-6203|pmc=3340347|pmid=22558393|last3=Marchetti|first3=Federico|last4=Montico|first4=Marcella|last5=Vecchi Brumatti|first5=Liza|last6=Bavcar|first6=Alessandro|last7=Grasso|first7=Domenico|last8=Barbiero|first8=Chiara|last9=Tamburlini|first9=Giorgio}}</ref>。一半的個案是發生在小於五歲的幼童而且大多為男性<ref name="Min2014" /><ref name=Mon2012/>。在急性中耳炎感染的病例中，約4.8%或是三千一百萬的個案會發展成慢性化膿性中耳炎<ref name="Mon2012" /><!--Before the age of ten OME affects about 80% of children at some point in time.(曾在一段時間內, 中耳積水影響了近八成未屆10歲的兒童)--><ref name="Min2014" />。中耳炎可能会造成颅内感染等并发症，需要检测[[C-反应蛋白]]、血常规的白细胞是否明显增高。1990年中耳炎在全世界造成4900件的死亡案例，在2013年時死亡案例已降至2400件<ref name="GBD204">{{Cite journal|title=Global, regional, and national age–sex specific all-cause and cause-specific mortality for 240 causes of death, 1990–2013: a systematic analysis for the Global Burden of Disease Study 2013|url=https://linkinghub.elsevier.com/retrieve/pii/S0140673614616822|date=2015-01|journal=The Lancet|issue=9963|doi=10.1016/S0140-6736(14)61682-2|volume=385|pages=117–171|language=en|pmc=4340604|pmid=25530442|access-date=2020-10-28|archive-date=2021-02-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210213063215/https://linkinghub.elsevier.com/retrieve/pii/S0140673614616822|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

