'''二尖瓣脫垂'''或'''僧帽瓣脫垂'''（{{langx|en|Mitral valve prolapse, MVP}}）是一種{{tsl|en|valvular heart disease||瓣膜性心臟病}}，特徵是異常增厚的[[二尖瓣]]瓣葉在[[心臟收縮|收縮期]]向[[左心房]]突出<ref name="hayek" />。 它是瓣膜{{tsl|en|myxomatous degeneration||黏液狀變性}}的一種主要型態。二尖瓣脫垂可分為多種類型，廣義上分為典型與非典型兩種。在嚴重的典型病例中的可能併發症，包括：[[二尖瓣閉鎖不全]]、[[感染性心內膜炎]]、充血性[[心臟衰竭]]及較少見的[[心臟驟停]]。

二尖瓣脫垂的診斷主要依賴[[心臟超音波]]，利用[[超聲波]]顯示二尖瓣的結構與運動。二尖瓣脫垂是最常見的瓣膜異常之一，估計影響約2–3%的人口，約每40人中有1人可能患有此病<ref name="hayek">{{cite journal | vauthors = Hayek E, Gring CN, Griffin BP | title = Mitral valve prolapse | url = https://archive.org/details/sim_the-lancet_february-5-11-2005_365_9458/page/507 | journal = Lancet | volume = 365 | issue = 9458 | pages = 507–518 | year = 2005 | pmid = 15705461 | doi = 10.1016/S0140-6736(05)17869-6 | s2cid = 11950601 }}</ref><ref name="Toomer2019">{{cite journal | vauthors = Toomer KA, Yu M, Fulmer D, Guo L, Moore KS, Moore R, Drayton KD, Glover J, Peterson N, Ramos-Ortiz S, Drohan A, Catching BJ, Stairley R, Wessels A, Lipschutz JH, Delling FN, Jeunemaitre X, Dina C, Collins RL, Brand H, Talkowski ME, Del Monte F, Mukherjee R, Awgulewitsch A, Body S, Hardiman G, Hazard ES, da Silveira WA, Wang B, Leyne M, Durst R, Markwald RR, Le Scouarnec S, Hagege A, Le Tourneau T, Kohl P, Rog-Zielinska EA, Ellinor PT, Levine RA, Milan DJ, Schott JJ, Bouatia-Naji N, Slaugenhaupt SA, Norris RA | display-authors = 6 | title = Primary cilia defects causing mitral valve prolapse | journal = Science Translational Medicine | volume = 11 | issue = 493 | date = May 2019 | pmid = 31118289 | pmc = 7331025 | doi = 10.1126/scitranslmed.aax0290 }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|date=2021-10-16|title=Mitral Valve Prolapse: Practice Essentials, Background, Pathophysiology|url=https://emedicine.medscape.com/article/155494-overview|access-date=2026-05-06|archive-date=2022-03-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220323201326/https://emedicine.medscape.com/article/155494-overview|url-status=live}}</ref>。

此病最早由{{tsl|en|John Brereton Barlow||約翰·布雷頓·巴洛}}於1966年描述<ref name="Barlow-1966" />。 隨後由{{tsl|en|J. Michael Criley||麥可·克萊利}}命名為「二尖瓣脫垂」<ref name="pmid5942469">{{cite journal|vauthors=Criley JM, Lewis KB, Humphries JO, Ross RS|title=Prolapse of the mitral valve: clinical and cine-angiocardiographic findings|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_british-heart-journal_1966-07_28_4/page/488|journal=British Heart Journal|volume=28|issue=4|pages=488–496|date=July 1966|pmid=5942469|pmc=459076|doi=10.1136/hrt.28.4.488}}</ref>。 瓣葉脫垂產生的心雜音，包括收縮中期噴射音（{{langx|en|mid-systolic click}}）與收縮期雜音（{{langx|en|systolic murmur}}）早在1887年由卡弗（{{langx|en|M. Cuffer}}）醫師與下巴 （{{langx|en|M. Barbillon}}）醫師用[[聽診器]]記錄到<ref name=":0" /><ref>{{cite journal|vauthors=Grau JB, Pirelli L, Yu PJ, Galloway AC, Ostrer H|title=The genetics of mitral valve prolapse|journal=Clinical Genetics|volume=72|issue=4|pages=288–295|date=October 2007|pmid=17850623|doi=10.1111/j.1399-0004.2007.00865.x|s2cid=40874345}}</ref><ref>{{cite journal|vauthors=Anyanwu AC, Adams DH|title=Etiologic classification of degenerative mitral valve disease: Barlow's disease and fibroelastic deficiency|journal=Seminars in Thoracic and Cardiovascular Surgery|volume=19|issue=2|pages=90–96|date=2007|pmid=17870001|doi=10.1053/j.semtcvs.2007.04.002}}</ref>。

