'''共济失调'''<ref>{{术语在线|term =共济失调 |urlid =a8f0f43226ae11eebee8b068e6519520 |access-date = }}</ref>（{{lang|en|ataxia}}）又称'''运动失调'''<ref>{{樂詞網|term =運動失調 |urlid =e60ea8246d6846d8242b27fb3d54ff8e |access-date = }}</ref>，是在[[肌力]]正常的情况下出现的[[随意运动]]协调障碍，可累及[[四肢]]、[[躯干]]及[[咽喉肌]]，表现为[[姿势]]、[[步态]]和[[构音]]障碍。“共济”的意思是在互相帮助下共同成事，而共济失调意思就是肌肉之间不能协作<ref>{{cite book |title=中国医学百科全书, 第 16 卷 |date=1980 |publisher=上海科学技术出版社 |page=56}}</ref><ref>王钰,罗冬梅.屈膝屈肘时肌肉协同工作规律研究[C]//2011第九届全国体育科学大会论文摘要汇编(1).2011.</ref>。

造成共济失调的[[神经系统]]病变或损伤处，可在[[小脑]]、[[大脑]]、[[脊髓]][[索 (神经解剖学)|后索]]，以及任何影响[[本体感觉]]及[[前庭迷路]]功能的部位，进而引发动态失调、静止失调，产生机体动作协调不良及平衡功能障碍。按障碍部位分为：小脑性共济失调、大脑性共济失调、脊髓性共济失调、脑干性共济失调、前庭迷路性共济失调。共济失调最常见的表现为[[步态不稳]]，且可表现为动作不准确、不流畅，以致不能顺利完成。当累及躯干、四肢和咽喉肌时可分别引起身体平衡、姿势、步态及言语障碍。

國際共濟失調意識日為九月二十五日<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.ataxia.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/2018-IAAD-Awareness-Campaign-Toolkit.pdf|title=International Ataxia Awareness Day|publisher=National Ataxia Foundation|date=2018|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20210814064303/https://www.ataxia.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/2018-IAAD-Awareness-Campaign-Toolkit.pdf|archivedate=2021|deadurl=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.rcslt.org/wp-content/uploads/media/September-2020.pdf|title=September 2020 Awareness Events|publisher=Royal College of Speech and Language Therapists|date=2020| archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20210814064834/https://www.rcslt.org/wp-content/uploads/media/September-2020.pdf|archivedate=2021|deadurl=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web| url=https://www.lomondpractice.co.uk/website/F20606/files/Events%20calendar%20LR%200321.pdf|title=Calendar of health events|publisher=Lomond Practice|date=2021|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20210814064404/https://www.lomondpractice.co.uk/website/F20606/files/Events%20calendar%20LR%200321.pdf|archivedate=2021|deadurl=no}}</ref>。

