'''憩室病'''（Diverticulosis）是指[[结肠]]中有多个肠壁[[憩室]]，即结肠[[黏膜]]和[[黏膜下层]]通过[[肌层]]的弱点向外[[疝]]出形成的凸起外袋<ref name="Feuerstein2016">{{Cite journal |last1=Feuerstein |first1=JD |last2=Falchuk |first2=KR |date=August 2016 |title=Diverticulosis and Diverticulitis |journal=Mayo Clinic Proceedings |type=Review |volume=91 |issue=8 |pages=1094–1104 |doi=10.1016/j.mayocp.2016.03.012 |pmid=27156370 |doi-access=free}}</ref>。大多数人的憩室不会引起症状<ref name="NIH2013">{{Cite web |date=September 2013 |title=Diverticular Disease |url=http://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/health-topics/digestive-diseases/diverticular-disease/Pages/facts.aspx |access-date=12 June 2016 |website=www.niddk.nih.gov |archive-date=2016-06-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160613120254/http://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/health-topics/digestive-diseases/diverticular-disease/Pages/facts.aspx |dead-url=no }}</ref>，但当憩室内出现[[病原体]]滋生时，就会导致[[炎症]]病变，这种情况称为[[憩室炎]]<ref name="pmid26202723">{{Cite journal |vauthors=Tursi A, Papa A, Danese S |date=September 2015 |title=Review article: the pathophysiology and medical management of diverticulosis and diverticular disease of the colon |journal=Alimentary Pharmacology & Therapeutics |volume=42 |issue=6 |pages=664–84 |doi=10.1111/apt.13322 |pmid=26202723 |doi-access=free |s2cid=24568867}}</ref>。

憩室通常发生在乙状结肠，这是常见的压力增加。结肠左侧在美国更常见，而右侧在亚洲更常见。<ref name="Tur2016">{{Cite journal |last=Tursi |first=A |date=March 2016 |title=Diverticulosis today: unfashionable and still under-researched |journal=Therapeutic Advances in Gastroenterology |volume=9 |issue=2 |pages=213–28 |doi=10.1177/1756283X15621228 |pmc=4749857 |pmid=26929783}}</ref>诊断通常是在常规结肠镜检查期间或作为CT 扫描期间的偶然发现。<ref name="NIH2013"/>

