'''抽动障碍'''（tic disorders，TD）<ref>{{Cite journal |title=儿童抽动障碍的心理教育与行为干预治疗的研究进展 |url=https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7389019/ |journal=Chinese Journal of Contemporary Pediatrics |date=2018-11-25 |volume=20 |issue=11 |doi=10.7499/j.issn.1008-8830.2018.11.018 |issn=1008-8830 |pmc=7389019 |pmid=30477633 |access-date=2023-12-06 |archive-date=2023-12-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231202023413/https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7389019/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>又称'''抽动症'''<ref>{{Cite web |title=天坛科普——儿童抽动症是“症”不是“病” |url=https://wjw.beijing.gov.cn/bmfw_20143/jkzs/jksh/202111/t20211129_2547212.html |website=wjw.beijing.gov.cn |access-date=2025-03-07 |archive-date=2023-12-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231202023412/https://wjw.beijing.gov.cn/bmfw_20143/jkzs/jksh/202111/t20211129_2547212.html |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>https://www.taic.mohw.gov.tw/public/hygiene/cab5e4977af33ff172f19be55d9319e0.pdf{{Dead link}}</ref>，为一种有遗传倾向而於兒童時期發病的复杂慢性[[神经精神障碍]]；發病時不但會出現神经学症状（突发性、快速、不自主、无明显目的、反复、無節律的一个部位或多部位肌肉运动抽动、发声抽动），亦伴有精神病学症状（注意力不集中、过动、强迫性动作和思维，或其他行为症状）<ref name="phenomenology">{{Cite journal |last=Leckman |first=James F. |last2=Bloch |first2=Michael H. |last3=King |first3=Robert A. |last4=Scahill |first4=Lawrence |title=Phenomenology of tics and natural history of tic disorders |url=https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16536348/?dopt=Abstract |journal=Advances in Neurology |date=2006 |volume=99 |page=1-16 |issn=0091-3952 |pmid=16536348 |access-date=2025-03-07 |archive-date=2024-12-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241209060732/https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16536348/?dopt=Abstract |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="BehaveNet">{{Cite web |title=Diagnostic criteria for 307.23 Tourette's Disorder {{!}} BehaveNet |url=https://www.behavenet.com/diagnostic-criteria-30723-tourettes-disorder |website=www.behavenet.com |access-date=2025-03-07}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=术语在线 |url=https://www.termonline.cn/search?searchText=tic |website=www.termonline.cn |access-date=2025-03-07 |archive-date=2023-12-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231202022505/https://www.termonline.cn/search?searchText=tic |dead-url=no }}</ref>。有些特定的不隨意動作很難被旁人察覺，如[[腳趾]]的扭動或腹部肌肉的抽動。

通常抽動障礙可以分成聲音型和運動型。常見的運動型抽動有頻繁地[[眨眼|眨眼睛]]、扭動或後仰[[脖子]]等；常見的聲音型抽動有清喉嚨或發出呼氣吞氣的聲響等<ref>{{Cite journal |last=Malone |first=Donald A. |last2=Pandya |first2=Mayur M. |title=Behavioral neurosurgery |url=https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16536372/?dopt=Abstract |journal=Advances in Neurology |date=2006 |volume=99 |page=241-247 |issn=0091-3952 |pmid=16536372 |access-date=2025-03-07 |archive-date=2024-12-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241209060310/https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16536372/?dopt=Abstract |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

抽動障礙是[[妥瑞症]]主要的症狀。此類疾病男患者多于女患者<ref name="BehaveNet" /><ref>{{cite news |title=儿童抽动障碍诊断与治疗专家共识(2017实用版) |url=http://rs.yiigle.com/m/CN101070201715/1004566.htm |publisher=中華實用兒科臨床雜誌}}</ref><ref name="Swain">{{Cite journal |last=Swain |first=James E. |last2=Scahill |first2=Lawrence |last3=Lombroso |first3=Paul J. |last4=King |first4=Robert A. |last5=Leckman |first5=James F. |title=Tourette Syndrome and Tic Disorders: A Decade of Progress |url=https://linkinghub.elsevier.com/retrieve/pii/S0890856709615471 |journal=Journal of the American Academy of Child & Adolescent Psychiatry |language=En |date=2007-08-01 |volume=46 |issue=8 |page=947-968 |doi=10.1097/chi.0b013e318068fbcc |issn=0890-8567 |pmid=17667475 |access-date=2025-03-07 |archive-date=2025-03-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250314082321/https://linkinghub.elsevier.com/retrieve/pii/S0890856709615471 |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

