'''梭形细胞脂肪瘤'''（spindle cell lipoma）是一种无症状、生长缓慢的皮下肿瘤，多見於老年男性的背部、颈部和肩部。<ref name="Andrews">James, William; Berger, Timothy; Elston, Dirk (2005). ''Andrews' Diseases of the Skin: Clinical Dermatology''. (10th ed.). Saunders. {{ISBN|0-7216-2921-0}}.</ref>{{Rp|625}}<ref name="Bolognia">{{Cite book|last=Rapini, Ronald P.|last2=Bolognia, Jean L.|last3=Jorizzo, Joseph L.|title=Dermatology: 2-Volume Set|publisher=Mosby|location=St. Louis|year=2007|isbn=978-1-4160-2999-1}}</ref>

