<!-- 定義與病徵 -->
'''淋巴瘤'''（{{langx|en|lymphoma}}），又稱'''淋巴癌'''，是由[[淋巴細胞]]病變造成的{{link-en|血液細胞瘤|blood cell tumors}}<ref name="D2000">{{Cite book |title=''Dorland's illustrated medical dictionary'' |date=2000 |publisher=Saunders |location=Philadelphia |accessdate=2025-05-29 |isbn=978-0-7216-6254-1 |editor-last=Anderson |editor-first=Douglas M. |editor2-last=Dorland |editor2-first=William A. Newman |edition=29. ed |pages=1038}}</ref>。此名稱被用來單指[[癌症]]形式，而非所有這類腫瘤。最常見的早期症狀是無痛性[[淋巴結|淋巴結腫大]]；而全身性症狀，例如[[發燒]]、[[盜汗]]、體重減輕（此三者合稱 B symptoms）、疲倦感甚或[[皮膚癢]]通常在晚期才出現，盜汗則通常在夜間發生<ref name="HL2014">{{cite web |title=General Information About Adult Hodgkin Lymphoma |url=http://www.cancer.gov/cancertopics/pdq/treatment/adulthodgkins/Patient/page1/AllPages |website=National Cancer Institute |date=2014-04-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140705231802/http://www.cancer.gov/cancertopics/pdq/treatment/adulthodgkins/Patient/page1/AllPages |archive-date=2014-07-05 |accessdate=2014-06-20 |dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name="NHL2014">{{cite web |title=General Information About Adult Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma |url=http://www.cancer.gov/cancertopics/pdq/treatment/adult-non-hodgkins/Patient/page1/AllPages |website=National Cancer Institute |date=2014-04-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140705115658/http://www.cancer.gov/cancertopics/pdq/treatment/adult-non-hodgkins/Patient/page1/AllPages |archive-date=2014-07-05 |accessdate=2014-06-20 |dead-url=no}}</ref>。

==分類==
淋巴瘤為{{link-en|造血淋巴組織腫瘤|Tumors of the hematopoietic and lymphoid tissues}}的一部分<ref>{{Cite journal |last=Vardiman |first=James W. |last2=Thiele |first2=Jüergen |last3=Arber |first3=Daniel A. |last4=Brunning |first4=Richard D. |last5=Borowitz |first5=Michael J. |last6=Porwit |first6=Anna |last7=Harris |first7=Nancy Lee |last8=Le Beau |first8=Michelle M. |last9=Hellström-Lindberg |first9=Eva |last10=Tefferi |first10=Ayalew |last11=Bloomfield |first11=Clara D. |title=The 2008 revision of the World Health Organization (WHO) classification of myeloid neoplasms and acute leukemia: rationale and important changes |url=https://ashpublications.org/blood/article/114/5/937/103719/The-2008-revision-of-the-World-Health-Organization |journal=Blood |date=2009-07-30 |volume=114 |issue=5 |page=937-951 |doi=10.1182/blood-2009-03-209262 |issn=0006-4971 |pmid=19357394 |access-date=2025-05-29 |archive-date=2025-05-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250520035204/https://ashpublications.org/blood/article/114/5/937/103719/The-2008-revision-of-the-World-Health-Organization |dead-url=no }}</ref>。一般依據細胞形態學，主要分為兩大類：[[何杰金氏淋巴瘤]]和[[非何杰金氏淋巴瘤]]<ref name=Society2013>{{cite book|title=The Lymphoma Guide Information for Patients and Caregivers|date=2013|publisher=Leukemia and Lymphoma Society|url=http://www.lls.org/content/nationalcontent/resourcecenter/freeeducationmaterials/lymphoma/pdf/lymphomaguide.pdf|accessdate=2014-06-20|archive-date=2015-02-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150225223623/http://www.lls.org/content/nationalcontent/resourcecenter/freeeducationmaterials/lymphoma/pdf/lymphomaguide.pdf|dead-url=no}}</ref>，而其他包含在[[世界衛生組織]]分類中的尚有[[多發性骨髓瘤]]及{{link-en|淋巴增生性疾病|Lymphoproliferative disorders}}<ref name=WCR2014>{{cite book|title=World Cancer Report 2014.|url=https://archive.org/details/worldcancerrepor0000unse_p0u5|date=2014|publisher=World Health Organization|isbn=9283204298|pages=Chapter 5.13}}</ref>。
* 何杰金氏淋巴瘤有典型的{{link-en|Reed–Sternberg細胞|Reed–Sternberg cell}}，發生率較低，發病年齡較早，治療預後較好。
* 非何杰金氏淋巴瘤無上述細胞，發生率較高，佔所有淋巴瘤的90%，其中包含各種次分類<ref name=Society2013 /><ref>{{cite web|title=Lymphoma|url=http://www.cancer.gov/dictionary?cdrid=45368|website=NCI|accessdate=2014-06-13|archive-date=2015-04-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150425041030/http://www.cancer.gov/dictionary?CdrID=45368|dead-url=no}}</ref>，發病年齡較晚，治療預後較差。

== 可能成因 ==
淋巴瘤的可能成因包括家族病史、[[遺傳基因]]病變、[[病毒]]感染、幽門螺旋桿菌等細菌感染、[[輻射]]、化學藥物及體內免疫系統失常等有關。
* 何杰金氏淋巴瘤的風險因子包含[[EB病毒]]和其他同病毒科<ref name=HL2014 />。
* 非何杰金氏淋巴瘤的風險因子則包含[[自體免疫疾病]]、[[愛滋病|人類免疫缺乏病毒或愛滋病]]、{{link-en|人類T淋巴細胞病毒|Human T-lymphotropic virus}}感染、細菌引起的黏膜慢性發炎、攝取過量肉類及脂肪、使用[[免疫抑制劑]]、及部分[[農藥|殺蟲劑]]。

== 症狀 ==
淋巴腺腫大是淋巴瘤患者最常見的病徵，若癌細胞擴散至[[骨髓]]並損害造血系統時，會出現[[貧血]]、瘀腫及經常受細菌感染等現象。其他病徵包括持續發熱、夜間出汗、呼吸急促、消瘦、皮膚瘙癢和持續疲倦等。

==診斷==
通常藉由血液、尿液、[[骨髓檢查]]診斷淋巴癌<ref name=NHL2014 />，而淋巴結[[活體組織切片|切片]]可能有助於診斷<ref name=HL2014 /><ref name=NHL2014 />。[[醫學影像]]可用於淋巴癌細胞是否轉移<ref name=HL2014 /><ref name=NHL2014 />，而可發生轉移處有肺、肝、腦等<ref name=HL2014 /><ref name=NHL2014 />。

==治療與癒後==
治療淋巴瘤可能會合併[[化學治療]]、[[放射線治療]]、[[標靶治療]]及[[手術]]等多種方式<ref name=HL2014 />。非何杰金氏淋巴瘤患者的血液可能因[[蛋白質]]成分增多而較濃稠，需要接受[[血漿置換]]的治療<ref name=HL2014 />。某些型態的淋巴瘤可能必須採用所謂「[[觀察等待]]」的策略<ref name=HL2014 />，而某些型態則可治癒<ref name=Society2013 />。在美國，何杰金氏淋巴瘤的[[五年整體存活率]]約85%<ref name="seer">{{cite web |url=http://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/hodg.html |title=Hodgkin Lymphoma—SEER Stat Fact Sheets |publisher=Seer.cancer.gov |accessdate=2012-08-26 |archive-date=2012-10-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20121017064937/http://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/hodg.html |dead-url=no }}</ref>，而非何杰金氏淋巴瘤則僅69%<ref>{{cite web|title=SEER Stat Fact Sheets: Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma|url=http://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/nhl.html|website=NCI|accessdate=2014-06-18|archive-date=2014-07-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140706125600/http://www.seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/nhl.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。<!-- 流行病學 -->在2012年，約有566,000人罹患淋巴瘤，並造成305,000死亡<ref name=WCR2014 />，佔所有癌症的3至4%，為第七常見<ref name=WCR2014 /><ref name=Rob2013>{{cite book|last1=Marcus|first1=Robert|title=Lymphoma : pathology, diagnosis and treatment|date=2013|isbn=9781107010598|page=1|edition=Second edition.|url=http://books.google.ca/books?id=SX0LAgAAQBAJ&lpg=PP1|access-date=2014-12-08|archive-date=2014-10-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20141006132913/http://books.google.ca/books?id=SX0LAgAAQBAJ&lpg=PP1|dead-url=no}}</ref>，而在兒童則為第三常見<ref>{{Cite book |title=''Abeloff's clinical oncology'' |url=https://archive.org/details/abeloffsclinical0000nied |date=2014 |publisher=Elsevier, Saunders |location=Philadelphia, Pa |accessdate=2025-05-29 |isbn=978-1-4557-2865-7 |editor-last=Niederhuber |editor-first=John E. |editor2-last=Abeloff |editor2-first=Martin D. |edition=5. ed |series=ExpertConsult.com |chapter=Chapter 57}}</ref>。相對於[[開發中國家]]，淋巴瘤通常多發生在[[已開發國家]]<ref name=WCR2014 />。[[非何杰金氏淋巴瘤]]在美國的五年存活率為72%，[[何杰金氏淋巴瘤]]的五年存活率为87%<ref>{{Cite web|title=Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma - Cancer Stat Facts|url=https://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/nhl.html|accessdate=2020-02-04|work=SEER|language=en|archive-date=2019-04-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190401204631/https://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/nhl.html|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Hodgkin Lymphoma - Cancer Stat Facts|url=https://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/hodg.html|accessdate=2020-02-04|work=SEER|language=en|archive-date=2019-02-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190225165645/https://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/hodg.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

